      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KEAYANG GYPSY (9) worked to get to the lead and kept finding to score last time out when resuming over 1720m at this track, getting home by 2.25 metres. Meets a similar line up so she can keep the ball rolling. JILLIBY TOPGUN (2) raced on the pace and was too strong late last start over 1690m at Shepparton, getting home by 1.5 metres to add to some outstanding results of late. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Taking on a better line-up this time but he has the ability to mix it with them. CENTURION DREAM (4) is in the mix following a fifth at her most recent appearance over 2240m at this track. CARLA PIXIE NZ (8) must be considered after she finished third over 1720m at this track two weeks ago.",
